    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-10f6076e-0a12-46aa-a700-886aaa538aac" n="0745" facs="#m-f80f163a-fc60-4653-8832-7aab7e4ab66a" /><div xml:id="m-6d80f33f-5d28-4dfc-bc14-b06122c70a2a">
            <lg xml:id="m-e563627c-d53d-4fcb-aa42-77a7771b914e">
              <l xml:id="m-d6fd9e5e-4e9a-44b2-9354-6d4f25ea2b3c" facs="#m-591e1fbc-f6e7-413f-8895-51a7193e380b" label="ambiguous">509</l><l xml:id="m-a7f16f42-87d9-4aaa-b003-5dbbe7c6bea0" facs="#m-c8dd2a52-ff50-4289-901f-4c917c6761c5" label="text-like">At Mas¬</l><l xml:id="m-cfc171a5-3d48-4880-8136-91bfa8c3e526" facs="#m-85fb1b7a-5c41-41ba-8aa0-f617a4f9b68b" label="ambiguous">Passio Domini nostri Jesu Christi secundum Matthaeum.</l><l xml:id="m-98976c9d-c2bf-4f7f-8691-1e57e17cc132" facs="#m-15c9e241-00e4-49be-b17a-ada0b66354c6" label="ambiguous">26, 36-75, 27, 1-60</l><l xml:id="m-1038ee1f-8c35-4073-a9e0-751c846c00d7" facs="#m-363cd8a2-122d-410a-b752-a3438f063dea" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Venit Jesus ¡ipse est, tenéte eum. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-85be0b61-e6b1-4cdc-aee9-d68fa49f6e95" facs="#m-d6f15767-e2f6-417d-95a9-f562f3723447" label="lyrics-like">L cum discipulis suis in villam, (conféstim accédens ad Jesum,</l><l xml:id="m-816bc934-39f2-48b5-aead-7bc95ad148ea" facs="#m-4ec3f02f-6ba8-4fcd-828a-934952dac9f6" label="lyrics-like">quae dícitur Gethsémani, et dixit dixit: S. Ave, Rabbi. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-8e08697c-7f84-4697-a580-4a58147748eb" facs="#m-7e173b41-47a9-4f8b-8048-15d6508c43c1" label="lyrics-like">discípulis suis: 4 Sedéte hic,</l><l xml:id="m-bbfeaf23-9f0a-40e0-85ae-4f1433854113" facs="#m-cbdf206b-562e-42d4-84a3-361a5bbe641d" label="lyrics-like">osculátus est eum. Dixitque ili</l><l xml:id="m-f2199702-cdcc-4dc2-bf76-74237cad9420" facs="#m-00edf1df-008d-4c57-acf0-d080f066ea15" label="ambiguous">donec vadam illuc, et orem.</l><l xml:id="m-647a0ac2-5611-4034-acc2-c80750f81168" facs="#m-ceda7c64-6a03-43d8-b443-5ffa822827ab" label="ambiguous">Jesus: ★ Amice, ad quid</l><l xml:id="m-e2f83019-ac95-4e77-9e4c-dbd11d4b18b7" facs="#m-f38f470a-408b-4206-a5ff-f90bf28bfedb" label="lyrics-like">C. Et assúmpto Petro, et duóbus</l><l xml:id="m-704d01a8-50a6-48cd-91fc-89cb0821fc2f" facs="#m-628a56eb-5f18-4a5c-b02a-5ad478274ce4" label="lyrics-like">venisti? C. Tunc accessérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-289ae42b-ee11-4a9e-a81e-991d9527cadc" facs="#m-4e3c4734-98c4-4f8a-a407-842131cdf42f" label="lyrics-like">filiis zebedaéi, cœpit contri¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b6c6069-53bf-4917-b109-baea1540bf7b" facs="#m-40cd4408-12f9-424b-8879-50b3f38774d4" label="lyrics-like">et manus injecérunt in Jesum,</l><l xml:id="m-3e30e8c7-775e-46ac-b0dd-43db8dd419bd" facs="#m-98807d68-7281-4299-a226-0f4522e58cb6" label="lyrics-like">stári, et maestus esse. Tunc ait</l><l xml:id="m-60ea0d86-9249-4b47-8da0-6712da375f9d" facs="#m-0cf49102-ef51-407c-beb1-0bce242003d3" label="lyrics-like">et tenuérunt eum. Et ecce unus</l><l xml:id="m-07e803a3-2ad5-4fe5-bccb-42d210e3ab1e" facs="#m-38dc1294-1656-4021-9cc8-87dee97e91f7" label="ambiguous">ex his, qui erant cum Jesu,</l><l xml:id="m-20641001-1b80-491e-9c89-56b074e1ce62" facs="#m-6d9c076c-344f-4fca-9683-07a651135d8f" label="lyrics-like">illis:  Tristis est ánima mea</l><l xml:id="m-a623746d-68bf-48fa-b499-9d3c27108d87" facs="#m-d2c556b6-fbb7-4125-b337-efdf0409ecac" label="lyrics-like">exténdens manum, exémit glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f48761e0-1731-4d10-bf9e-3c497d5bf470" facs="#m-9a1d67dd-f1fa-40a6-8201-f2b952e485c4" label="lyrics-like">usque ad mortem: sustinéte</l><l xml:id="m-357d11ad-889f-4289-adcc-dd60c43f0858" facs="#m-43c9ffe5-57b4-46b2-b3e1-7223af3b6fd7" label="lyrics-like">hic, et vigilâte mecum. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-53d471e4-db79-4e41-8c00-522381ce7335" facs="#m-5dfd7118-8925-41fa-b5af-cffb7efe797f" label="lyrics-like">dium suum, et percútiens ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-05e7d466-0f1a-4e8d-a147-44ea27221cc3" facs="#m-51383391-4afa-4a84-8e28-5aa17bb61cca" label="lyrics-like">progréssus pusillum, prócidit in</l><l xml:id="m-5a634ab8-1a26-4e86-9ff6-7c123a38c895" facs="#m-57556852-ca76-4e15-931d-8d86f74398f3" label="lyrics-like">vum principis sacerdótum, am¬</l><l xml:id="m-1325f3f3-5576-4ebf-b93b-5bad52c8ab17" facs="#m-670159f1-9cef-4577-88d3-b2f8c9d82959" label="lyrics-like">putávit aurículam ejus. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-6ca17f9b-7fa5-42ec-b96a-925e1237be98" facs="#m-b1c4a4fb-28f8-4f4e-b48a-d68534f53209" label="lyrics-like">fáciem suam, orans, et dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-88c910c0-14c1-4ff9-b721-7d6e14df9712" facs="#m-084053f3-12e1-4cb8-90d5-70310bf670ec" label="ambiguous">4 Pater mi, si possibile est,</l><l xml:id="m-73d7ac6d-d068-4111-9c3c-18c770a57fd2" facs="#m-9270d0b0-fc14-4421-b711-225846dfdc2c" label="lyrics-like">ait illi Jesus: 4 Convérte</l><l xml:id="m-a5ff1627-c209-483b-8e55-741327697e50" facs="#m-cea12e72-e9ee-4eee-8382-3ec5de1dc6c4" label="lyrics-like">tránseat a me calix iste. Verúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-b141373a-0112-4a0c-935e-08d80a04943b" facs="#m-bb2ffc2c-f41c-4205-962e-18130f4ebc0c" label="lyrics-like">gládium tuum in locum suum.</l><l xml:id="m-73d3b850-cca1-4eae-9e7a-2edbee482cd1" facs="#m-2b0126d8-57a4-4659-b8c3-d4ab0aa49037" label="ambiguous">tamen non sicut ego volo,</l><l xml:id="m-2d77a8a6-44ac-4402-8f7f-91140b0fbe2f" facs="#m-242f5e25-d738-4e1f-943b-8434aa6a8e1a" label="lyrics-like">Omnes enim, qui accéperint glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-48e8a6cb-e748-428c-aeec-977d62030704" facs="#m-c977951c-e338-4d1a-9970-0d4e85d8a2f0" label="ambiguous">sed sicut tu. C. Et venit ad</l><l xml:id="m-fdf0c2f2-5bd1-4030-b11e-f8ecbedb1f9d" facs="#m-62b2b724-39dd-4c9c-be65-aa2738d2a678" label="lyrics-like">dium, gládio peribunt. An putas,</l><l xml:id="m-5e72a942-268f-4377-9b2c-058c87be6152" facs="#m-fc78e8f0-6f81-4425-8786-8fc1b64b3ac2" label="lyrics-like">discípulos suos, et invénit eos</l><l xml:id="m-0aabb87a-7caf-468d-9236-775cefd42697" facs="#m-e2955d62-8a75-4238-9bed-0d32ebaafcf7" label="lyrics-like">quia non possum rogâre Patrem</l><l xml:id="m-8ce97e0d-11e7-4881-9a30-de032030dc54" facs="#m-bcd2ff5b-82e1-4236-9324-74a8bd489a8e" label="lyrics-like">dormiéntes: et dicit Petro:</l><l xml:id="m-125a9514-ffd8-4dd2-86a3-9c7bfc021c17" facs="#m-85025196-35b1-4a56-9f8f-82bfd94e9256" label="lyrics-like">meum, et exhibébit mihi modo</l><l xml:id="m-087cc07f-42a0-4006-9bce-db3db884ac54" facs="#m-f4c864ae-a00f-4ec5-ad83-577b23ab69ba" label="lyrics-like">plus quam duódecim legiónes</l><l xml:id="m-d6c75fc2-82e1-4897-be60-d66ed25faa44" facs="#m-a73b3ad3-0ec4-4b55-be9f-c775afb8a4fc" label="ambiguous">★Sic non potuistis una hora</l><l xml:id="m-cc04b7e3-ec35-45f6-849d-2cc5b5710e25" facs="#m-1d95c14a-f99d-4d18-a316-b0dabdc5e43d" label="lyrics-like">vigiláre mecum? Vigiláte, et</l><l xml:id="m-18a8f2e3-7783-49fd-a031-1840318d76f0" facs="#m-f10a4b56-c2ec-4e36-9249-4b2eeb605053" label="lyrics-like">Angelórum? Quómodo ergo im¬</l><l xml:id="m-94909056-9b0d-4867-a6e8-dc226a0240a1" facs="#m-aed7bc81-57f7-493a-a7ff-cdaac0cdccca" label="lyrics-like">oráte, ut non intrétis in tenta¬</l><l xml:id="m-af14da4e-1056-4836-815f-29d674e2d93e" facs="#m-836fa42b-7c44-43d4-89a7-13eea08953c2" label="lyrics-like">plebúntur Scriptúrae, quia sic</l><l xml:id="m-bc89e151-1998-4c5d-9980-f8ebd4aa28d0" facs="#m-54bd9461-fe85-48da-beae-d57a4bd4168c" label="lyrics-like">tiónem. Spíritus quidem prom¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d318973-642f-4fde-8142-2293fa53d213" facs="#m-4d976bb3-4512-44e0-a1de-46c68074b8a5" label="lyrics-like">opórtet fieri?</l><l xml:id="m-6b482659-58bb-4bbb-92f9-cecc0d1b906e" facs="#m-dd934232-ed05-4daf-be52-d20e3c235ba5" label="ambiguous">C. In illa hora dixit Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-c39b695d-ebd1-4254-a2f3-a5efa78a41bf" facs="#m-b6e8d231-437e-4e32-85c3-c68e594e16b9" label="ambiguous">ptus est, caro autem infirma.</l><l xml:id="m-4d1501f8-b9bc-496d-b35f-b83642db57ef" facs="#m-c8c9d98e-e220-42a5-9a2c-cb8e85edef20" label="lyrics-like">turbis: ★ Tamquam ad latró¬</l><l xml:id="m-5160597a-64d5-42a8-b2e9-b48ca8b2af38" facs="#m-a7d48d43-6a66-4d43-a8cf-5e06935416be" label="lyrics-like">C. Iterum secúndo ábiit, et</l><l xml:id="m-b9157e82-52bc-4cae-a641-66950db065dc" facs="#m-30bf50f0-6eb5-4e60-936a-9cd4f48aaa62" label="lyrics-like">nem existis cum gládiis, et</l><l xml:id="m-21d05d68-0e11-41a1-b8ce-1033a4f367b5" facs="#m-9b3adf3f-3564-4f1d-8926-440792192c29" label="lyrics-like">orávit, dicens: 4 Pater mi, si</l><l xml:id="m-7e5d0709-f8f4-477e-a648-7852779bd16e" facs="#m-205b1c1c-18ad-4f1a-91be-edb65e44983f" label="lyrics-like">fústibus comprehéndere me</l><l xml:id="m-cc85a244-0690-4081-a1a9-ce1aa179b71f" facs="#m-56957459-b94b-412e-b338-454f95ceb310" label="lyrics-like">non potest hic calix transíre,</l><l xml:id="m-a5691871-1112-42db-9293-62ba3abb1eb6" facs="#m-0944d81c-9840-46e5-affd-60f0ed126f27" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-2412e369-54f6-4056-9a9b-e2cefc3b8a87" facs="#m-5169d395-9eeb-4638-87c3-9303c067914a" label="lyrics-like">nisi bibam illum, fiat volúntas</l><l xml:id="m-bcdaa7e8-d804-481c-a0b9-c82cdf8acff9" facs="#m-fe8d6888-7519-4fd9-903d-d49e95bb5367" label="lyrics-like">quotidie apud vos sedébam do¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1f74918-c6a0-436b-ac36-f967d6e44cea" facs="#m-b26dda2d-9ce8-4ae2-8b72-add00652f211" label="lyrics-like">tua. C. Et venit íterum, et</l><l xml:id="m-89d571db-6d2c-4fac-b11d-d9d4c53e57bf" facs="#m-1adf9993-3855-4ac8-a13d-5d4208d0adfa" label="ambiguous">cens in templo, et non me tenui¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c7d69ca-9c56-49bb-9eb3-501a45c934a8" facs="#m-722f07de-0c48-4aa7-b073-0fc66e4dfa6a" label="lyrics-like">invénit eos dormiéntes: erant</l><l xml:id="m-90cde030-4913-485d-8048-7de1281baead" facs="#m-3eb20e33-b5fe-49f2-9d91-97169c95b521" label="ambiguous">stis. C. Hoc autem totum factum</l><l xml:id="m-736457a3-810a-4012-870a-273271e9781f" facs="#m-1c9b05f2-8e8b-4cd0-af11-cd02e4c69422" label="lyrics-like">est, ut adimpleréntur Scripturae</l><l xml:id="m-97e5f8b8-6fb3-4ad3-91cd-96790b948161" facs="#m-30a784f4-0853-47f5-92e6-719823a38097" label="lyrics-like">enim óculi eórum graváti. Et</l><l xml:id="m-4d68c38f-73ec-472c-bc68-cc135aaed5e3" facs="#m-0b8bfc8a-0cf9-42e5-87a0-669a213ad4f8" label="lyrics-like">relictis illis, iterum ábit, et</l><l xml:id="m-ef09964e-1e7a-44aa-b94c-2d748c539817" facs="#m-a29f06a6-103f-47d1-af96-ac4e33495fab" label="lyrics-like">prophetárum. Tunc discipuli om¬</l><l xml:id="m-308ca439-5bdc-4b8c-97c4-6336d5ead910" facs="#m-27b5a156-dda7-4e5c-b196-dcda4f9d3758" label="lyrics-like">orávit tértio, eúmdem sermónem</l><l xml:id="m-d898c432-c471-48f3-9156-bdffe15b7c61" facs="#m-16d55493-122e-4988-ad4b-d38416264626" label="lyrics-like">nes, relicto eo, fugérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-8314f59d-3d2b-4ef0-9398-b990d15bc901" facs="#m-c19f7cf5-c50a-4941-81e2-c4a8a2985967" label="lyrics-like">At illi tenéntes Jesum, duxé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5edb08c0-248a-4685-89fc-5ad8d1cf0184" facs="#m-df014891-b599-4bab-8195-0c970e66184c" label="ambiguous">dicens. Tunc venit ad discipulos</l><l xml:id="m-7f55fdc1-1350-4a52-b5bc-507782785cc5" facs="#m-ccdedb1b-99ad-40c8-b8e5-3845135688d8" label="ambiguous">runt ad Caipham principem sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-95b4376d-82f4-4899-af31-883674c2d7da" facs="#m-b7d919f1-085c-4767-8c84-ed222ba3f8be" label="ambiguous">suos, et dicit illis: : Dormite</l><l xml:id="m-f2eef66d-7a95-42e9-b0ee-edff4de00364" facs="#m-31354e06-6b33-41c0-b8e8-6f091f8062ff" label="lyrics-like">cerdótum, ubi scribae et senióres</l><l xml:id="m-f2d30c1b-879d-4778-ba21-3b82ccb1a875" facs="#m-0faed02f-f4d6-44fb-903c-92367279f05b" label="lyrics-like">jam, et requiéscite : ecce appro¬</l><l xml:id="m-e454205c-9ac9-4d44-9a8c-e2cf9d28262d" facs="#m-cae3e708-9c75-45d0-8a93-e288d1a8aae9" label="lyrics-like">pinquávit hora, et Filius hóminis</l><l xml:id="m-4cb832d8-4e08-46d2-bda6-e10135d56742" facs="#m-1d626631-dbb2-4d59-b951-7ee491557c5c" label="lyrics-like">convénerant. Petrus autem se¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3d6410d-6f5f-416a-bd68-5c4750ff0d39" facs="#m-3eb88f21-a0f7-4334-a474-60e4bfeda187" label="lyrics-like">quebátur cum a longe, usque</l><l xml:id="m-492b055b-b620-45a4-8569-c6026a326f76" facs="#m-67a03640-6533-4c4f-a8de-64622ff4331d" label="lyrics-like">tradétur in manus peccatórum.</l><l xml:id="m-4cb6f11a-6a40-42bc-9f53-db64acd644ef" facs="#m-59f33e20-c162-4329-8aa5-ee47e82116f9" label="lyrics-like">súrgite, eámus: ecce appropin¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f9041a4-6afa-42de-9008-cc051e36f860" facs="#m-7e9ef0d7-aff7-4cf2-8dad-04076a7e6b62" label="lyrics-like">in átrium principis sacerdótum.</l><l xml:id="m-27217a54-a1f8-48bf-9be8-c59939f31cfa" facs="#m-6fab46c7-a6e6-4009-b76b-35ff17fee6af" label="lyrics-like">quávit qui me tradet.</l><l xml:id="m-f5bbf627-9007-4d1c-a060-ac8f81baa9e9" facs="#m-28023128-9123-4a6c-a973-23be55e31ecb" label="lyrics-like">Et ingréssus intro, sedébat cum</l><l xml:id="m-8c61f5a6-a7c9-4777-8a31-9e7ec00ac518" facs="#m-6a3e95e0-23ca-48f8-bd38-3c66ccdfe8af" label="lyrics-like">C. Adhuc eo loquénte, ecce</l><l xml:id="m-6af82172-efac-4260-ab8c-0a183ed5453c" facs="#m-406dca22-8fdf-4729-9257-7b6026042f1b" label="lyrics-like">minístris, ut vidéret finem. Prín¬</l><l xml:id="m-adcb09e3-c16d-49e8-b630-a49795b3de54" facs="#m-7cc2b629-07a0-4b0f-9b67-cb864e39b1a9" label="lyrics-like">Judas unus de duódecim venit,</l><l xml:id="m-e4862149-2381-42e3-8b19-fe5a6ebaf364" facs="#m-9b167ad5-4e61-4e50-88ca-b095e8baaf4c" label="lyrics-like">cipes autem sacerdótum, et omne</l><l xml:id="m-81dcfc25-8310-48cf-9838-67c28a71143f" facs="#m-70932fd6-c704-4f01-998e-14cae755a672" label="lyrics-like">et cum eo turba multa cum glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-306f641b-1d8b-4feb-8287-0923431cd00b" facs="#m-2434f0d6-c0e1-4988-8810-bccb8867859a" label="lyrics-like">concilium, quaerébant falsum</l><l xml:id="m-89c5fb32-82e4-4b96-b7cb-182259197d0a" facs="#m-6f1de6a1-ef6a-4607-a030-82c821a508be" label="lyrics-like">diis, et fústibus, missi a princi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4769310-a9f6-4cdc-996f-e5133655f1ff" facs="#m-291321e8-2559-4488-8681-bbeffab29ac9" label="lyrics-like">testimónium contra Jesum, ut</l><l xml:id="m-83df9261-0833-4d64-aea2-7ec47cdd1052" facs="#m-f3c224aa-0fe9-4715-8df8-564a6c502642" label="lyrics-like">pibus sacerdótum, et senióribus</l><l xml:id="m-1794f242-2363-4e74-9cc6-d928cecfbfb8" facs="#m-061101f4-98eb-4624-bfa1-cbcebe7972c7" label="lyrics-like">pópuli. Qui autem trádidit eum,</l><l xml:id="m-bb4e441d-795c-4969-98cf-2c36b4364a72" facs="#m-09c6c88b-3872-4b12-b8b7-ed15b5918b50" label="lyrics-like">invenérunt, cum multi falsi</l><l xml:id="m-d4de20ad-1713-4aee-b0a1-abd810eb1e30" facs="#m-3701c482-9d6d-486f-aef7-f8c065c7e5ae" label="lyrics-like">testes accessissent. Novíssime</l><l xml:id="m-932dc4de-dd13-4403-bed4-cbd265b17024" facs="#m-912d50f3-0742-4631-b9df-249cb328f281" label="ambiguous">dedit illis signum, dicens</l><l xml:id="m-004f64ae-7d9c-4a6d-ba4c-e43ea7c5bbd6" facs="#m-3734cbe2-7472-41ab-aaf2-e4cd571dda1c" label="lyrics-like">S. Quemcúmque osculátus füero,</l><l xml:id="m-fe6ea00e-eb54-449a-a548-d236850fe02f" facs="#m-88fee47d-7f04-414f-9f10-9a446a43cede" label="lyrics-like">autem venérunt duo falsi testes,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>